    "sourceSha256": "d5a603bcd6087e93c9f2492ba7922c9a0866358c2927ad44546d640f8c16f6db",
    "note": "RCSB assembly 1 of entry 5SYF, built by Mol* from the 26 helical operators the entry deposits, applied to its own asymmetric unit. The 26 operators place 52 tubulin chains and 177,268 atom sites: 26 copies of the 6,818-atom deposited dimer. Only the 775,288-byte asymmetric unit travels; the repeats are instanced by the renderer."
  },
